    schema:title "Fixed-Term Field Sales & Training Executive — Sephora UK" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/yepoda/fixed-term-field-sales-training-executive-sephora-uk-london-138981> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-forward-deployed-engineer-all-genders-munich-442239> a prov:Entity,
