    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/optiverus/graduate-quantitative-researcher-2027-start-london-60886> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-graduate-software-engineer-london-368153> a prov:Entity,
