    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/piabo/senior-manager-new-business-strategic-growth-berlin-b-416044> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-senior-marketing-project-manager-berlin-393674> a prov:Entity,
