            schema:name "Berlin" ] ;
    schema:title "Werkstudent:in Grafikdesign für Social Media (d/m/w)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/familie-redlich/werkstudentin-grafikdesign-fur-social-media-berlin-349899> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-werkstudentin-graphic-design-berlin-b-13953> a prov:Entity,
