    schema:title "Werkstudent:in (m/w/d) Recherche & Kommunikation" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/socialimpact/werkstudentin-recherche-kommunikation-berlin-heilbronner-strasse-237664> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-werkstudentin-retail-expansion-retail-growth-in-berlin-mitte-133079> a prov:Entity,
